      "purpose": "A nomain ILE RPG module that implements the main Mongoose HTTP server event handler for the BlueDroplet web framework. It receives all connection events (ACCEPT, RECEIVED, HTTP_REQUEST, CLOSE), performs ASCII-to-EBCDIC conversion on incoming data via iconv, and routes HTTP requests to user-defined endpoint handlers via a router. It uses EXTPROC for dynamic dispatch to endpoint handler procedures and includes several prototype headers for Mongoose, router, logger, iconv, and libc bindings.",
